{"_v":1,"id":"it-walks-around-the-house-at-night-west-end-2026","bd":{"positive":3,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Times (UK)","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.beyondthecurtain.co.uk/2026/02/it-walks-around-house-at-night-review.html"},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2026/feb/06/it-walks-around-the-house-at-night-review-minerva-theatre-chichester","d":"2026-02-06","q":"But the show is certainly worth experiencing for its thrills and spills, which stay with you, and follow you home."},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/it-walks-around-the-house-at-night-review","d":"2026-03-11","q":"But it’s a hugely enjoyable – and yes, scary – piece of theatre horror entertainment, and while it’s not even the only one of those you can catch in London these days, it still feels like a breath of fresh air in a musty old tomb."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Stage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/it-walks-around-the-house-at-night-review-southwark-playhouse-borough-london-thickskin","q":"It's slickly designed… but it's too wispy to support Foley's attempts to overlay it with weightier social themes."},{"cn":"Cindy Marcolina","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/Review-IT-WALKS-AROUND-THE-HOUSE-AT-NIGHT-Southwark-Playhouse-20260310","d":"2026-03-10","q":"It's entertaining and captivating, well-written, smoothly directed, and superbly acted."}],"au":{"score":90,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"lb":{"s":90,"c":4,"sr":4.5}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/5k4SBZnIWxn4idxzHCbOdM/e0bdc7f0a11bd4d8f4668dd20329a3a3/IWATHAN_SWK_onsale_TTX_1440x580.jpg","pd":"2026-03-04"}